9c04235a975","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deploy a noisy lure that attracts all creatures within radius %d to it for %d turns.\n\t\tIt has %d life (based on your Cunning) and is very durable, with %d armor and %d%% resistance to non-physical damage.\n\t\tAt level 5, when the lure is destroyed, it will trigger some traps in a radius of 2 around it (check individual trap descriptions to see if they are triggered).\n\t\tUse of this talent will not break stealth.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"抛出一个诱饵来吸引 %d 码半径内的敌人，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t诱饵有 %d 生命（基于灵巧），且非常坚韧，拥有 %d 护甲和 %d%% 非物理伤害抗性。\n\t\t在等级 5 时，当诱饵被摧毁时，它会触发其周围 2 码范围内的部分陷阱（请查看各陷阱自身的说明，以确认其是否会被触发）。\n\t\t此技能不会打断潜行状态。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f6e624be91b06e7b291ffd57deddb2fc1b6dc4731d6eb9976b42c5310e8d0ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7581518f9c1b9e2f76d4bbb58121e25c40fae41166e8a13e3a7da76d6e8f34dd","logical_entry_identity":"49d51184d1263d0ccc2ab5e3bab56913c9d825b3967573ed303a9fe3ff5fd032","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The spellblade","source_tag":"_t","target":"法术之刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0ecf4f0172fd28b970f6b5cf816758dcb898f1220b604ab3a39d0be89c5c797","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"758a84082e0ac5b813b6558d025cc014b771c9b5617914af8281a603e08cb7ec","logical_entry_identity":"423f518cadcc0a053758acddccf64ea8c15adad5a3b2ac575b25d3f9ca1332b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is using a two handed weapon in a single hand, reducing accuracy, physical power, spellpower and mindpower by %d%% (based on size); also all damage procs from your offhand are reduced by 50%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标单手使用双手武器，命中、物理、法术和精神强度下降 %d%%（受体型影响）；同时副手附加伤害减少 50%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b8cd48821661f72c103afcf30ac65eb59de887ac2e68c4d2197c6e3ca6334383","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"758c4900d6826c877b5979d69b406b676383d6d207f8399a11a875b10ee1502d","logical_entry_identity":"407a9f707281eb27d14246c42ac0e7e221fd19