f83a31216ca7c194991e06ea29e7418556d166a0d7f852aa8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"meta","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"超魔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c2beb15c7ec48d0a5596888850f8986d1b954d5e7f721a51279e87a09a2e247","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75a54c1c1e4941f6f155f6f97f981fbf75f55a2bdc5e0278e7263d3dac236f01","logical_entry_identity":"55f344e26db4f76586ab2ccd14f85b60cc50c3e21351ed3bf887257528020327","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dry, flesh-encrusted bone","source_tag":"_t","target":"干燥，带着肉的骨头"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a799c3d5ad2cd4d1173452acb0c3ec3dbd18491cc186c670f3e99eac679039cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75a81f42415df6268b1fd7e4d45bca7542011b2130f0853e62741430c9ad12da","logical_entry_identity":"e7cbe2ceee297db97caeb51f2b02ad830d0692ac9640c73c59162bcd1ba43aee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You rise to meet the pain that others would inflict on you. Every turn you take damage, your Strength and Willpower increase until they reach a maximum of +%d after 5 turns. Any turn in which you do not take damage will reduce the bonus. While in effect, your body also has a %d%% chance to overcome poisons and diseases each turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你勇于面对其他人带给你的痛苦。每回合当你承受伤害时，你将会增加你的力量和意志，直至在 5 回合后增加至最大值 +%d。\n\t\t每个你不承受伤害的回合会降低该增益效果。\n\t\t当此效果激活时，每回合你有 %d%% 的概率抵抗毒素和疾病效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1414f9fa92dfa4aa89ede38aff1b9e35490e58c0153a79cff5950134e85e405e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75a9d00f7a78a380ee5179cf265a2eec0686f75602191264bfa6e9d0ac3ab001","logical_entry_identity":"c84897eea44312908e516c3c9b5bc86bd5e48f0e102bd871e36dd76cca6c9d54","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"long sharp scalpel","source_tag":"_t","target":"锋利的长解剖刀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5182d76797c4e372cc7fb662d52442f03c3368d973633af5be6a82aeabb3ce7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75aacd832340492ec132b998772557825f001c07d579ec4e31949ccff86e7a85","logical_entry_identity":"75a3df9201b2bff60bce4c23a4797a067b1b6778bacb8159b282aef8d70bab42","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"endurance","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"耐久"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7fb1fe57a9448ccb533a8ce222f1d1140ec5d7946253a1f35df6a7563df48f6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75ab7bda9ad536787ef33f020a329ca792421a05bce9b86e7567fd64f12119a5","logical_entry_identity":"3d94c3f2d223af9d5b23fa41436000db94fba94c3e085c062685c72235ce81cb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#*As you open the door you notice a huge orc in the distance, covered in both flames and ice.*#LAST#\n@playerdescriptor.race@! You should never have come! Your doom awaits!\nThe Orc Pride will never yield to anybody! They have their precious and there is nothing you can do.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#VIOLET#*当你打开门，你注意到远处一个巨大的兽人，周身同时被烈焰与寒冰笼罩。*#LAST#\n@playerdescriptor.race@！你根本不该来这里！你的死期到了！\n兽人部落绝不会向任何人屈服！他们已经拿到了至宝，你什么也做不了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f5f03bb2c56f22ec3b07b75c051da882809322f5e6f74bf3c9179acf5e2dbd9d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75accec1b91c639321853ef52f3d90024ea0b7f918c4b03e1030c88b92a00d94","logical_entry_identity":"ec783c236d090305c155bdf32ebf3a136bf4bad8b96d134663bf92ec9f872b5a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An archer from the northern lands\nClaimed of his great renown\nWith peerless skill and countless trials\nHis name known town to town\n\nHe spoke of facing vampire lords\nWho promised years of pain\nThe archer gave a stern retort\nAn arrow through the brain\n\nA fighter from the southern lands\nClaimed armies fled his might\nWith dragons slain 'most every day\nAnd demons crushed by night\n\nHe spoke of ancient sprawling ruins\nHome to a ghastly shade\nIts years of madness, hate and rage\nWere ended on his blade\n\nAn archmage from the western lands\nClaimed kingdoms feared his name\nWith countless legends, songs and myths\nAttesting to his fame\n\nHe spoke of fire, storm and hail\nTo match the fiercest wyrm\nTo see one man hold so much power\nCan make an empire squirm\n\nA rogue who came from unknown lands\nNot known for anything\nA leap, a flash, a concealed blade\nThree heroes felt its sting\n\nThe archer dropped, his bow unplucked\nThe fighter died as well\nThe archmage found its poison\nFar too potent to dispel\n\nThe rogue is unknown to this day\nThough rumours persist still\nRogues aren't known by name or deed\nBut by the names they kill","source_tag":"_t","target":"北方来了一射手，\n自夸声名震四方；\n绝技在身经百战，\n城城镇镇知其名。\n\n他说曾战吸血领主，\n对方扬言折磨多年；\n射手只作冷冷一答：\n利箭径直贯穿脑间。\n\n南方来了一名战士，\n自称雄威吓退万军；\n白日屠龙稀松平常，\n入夜灭魔势若扫尘。\n\n他说曾入绵延古迹，\n那里盘踞骇人幽影；\n多年疯狂、仇恨、暴怒，\n尽数终结于他剑锋。\n\n西方来了一位大法师，\n自称诸国闻名胆寒；\n无数传奇、歌谣、神话，\n都为他的威名作传。\n\n他说烈火、风暴、冰雹，\n足以匹敌最凶巨龙；\n一人手握如此伟力，\n整个帝国也会惶恐。\n\n不知何处来了个盗贼，\n从来没有半点声名；\n一跃、一闪、一把暗刃，\n三位英雄同时中招。\n\n射手倒地，弓弦未响；\n战士随后也丧了命；\n大法师才发觉毒性，\n猛烈得根本无法驱净。\n\n至今无人知晓盗贼是谁，\n尽管传闻仍未停息；\n盗贼不以姓名事迹闻名，\n只以被他杀死者之名传世。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f1c8b96ca32f72350d931065b3d5e79bd64206e8d6589c78ecfcb556dc7bd28c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75b1afe732302550a6b27806d88e63a6f29e7d1cf132bb555d9e01cfef8e17d3","logical_entry_identity":"04cbedcf8d3d4c7a7c5b554c18767dd5b71193a6a4ef08b28088d700e4df75ef","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Middle mouse click assigned","source_tag":"_t","target":"已设置为鼠标中键"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae408583a44daf3b6bbaabc30aaea22fd16140cec9f75b4132994377c0a79790","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75b1f12866edc8d0fe88ac59353e99d067eb29259fca9f7d945de4fce58cd558","logical_entry_identity":"aeaf887e8d217b6b5c2f105d34a7682c24de9854301b77d054f6d9915f562b98","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"watchleader's ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"守望领主的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15f5993c07a759027f49924a9eb0da58eb6c1c06ebe505cbdd2a0e03490cc954","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75b2642549b0d3c8e21a170fa8fe576fcd9e99e911eb3f5a3bd67c2c0d2bb3df