er of the opponent's effect.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#物理豁免#LAST#\n增加你摆脱物理效果的几率。此外，基于目标强度判定后，每超过1点减少5%不良物理状态持续时间。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b7a8442c48f4c4c74006a80eac5c021d1c602ef68d524db3d85062c501066a8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75bfe8a87596e813a1c2feb57818c175edaa928882b9bc50ae462c2748fefa81","logical_entry_identity":"445e30d0d97d4022f98e85b9ca7812908aac58152953d90369ced732fd5b4f6f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A small scrap of paper written in a mocking tone.","source_tag":"_t","target":"用嘲弄的语调书写的小纸片。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fe619857f5b967ff63cdf1fc60a533ad53faeb9bf123482833a1de25351ac56","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75c0f481d0cad27c4f3d11458c188118f16a7376a951c94f0a34597e1a460d51","logical_entry_identity":"9f1216780aa6d4e573d43ae4492da3ff1e56af0391047337808d9d61353f46ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"eyal","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"埃亚尔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c925c4539314874f0e12fe8372db7b37875c0d3bbeda803a8c57c96939972cdf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75c83c13f9910d7fec3ceaeb89565ff8ea0b2a459f0e127a8b2faea9a75b0aee","logical_entry_identity":"2630ff4e29cde986225417d683df254429ab14ff14d25fa915e695dbc1b89fed","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A formation of purple crystal, but where the others could only be described as polyhedral, this construct seems to strangely resemble... you, if you were much, much larger.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一种紫色水晶，如果其他水晶可以被定义为多面体的话，那么这个水晶只能说……和你一样，如果你大个几倍的话。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"10eae9fd52f51c047c0b82b12d03298329084e8642a7e2ee2b14659b8807187b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75c84c3ff6ce35e3a585319291e88504cabeba8eaa1db5413bdee6619b4d9ef3","logical_entry_identity":"948eb303a49ed5e92f83f53a636d4016b9d19e8cbf32b7209bf9fcc06c40e3b1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s holds its ground!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 站稳在了原地！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d007496545dae2aae5b28d20c0affddcc3b503fd21e5bee958eec14841697801","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75c88e75162d2477aa36c9fc04098cefec28fd5d9324c85a8da77b5eceab6ea8","logical_entry_identity":"2bc407e3382e54da6c2319597f4fb7d555ae93947e2e81c974b183c0d29f4e71","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rune of Reflection","source_tag":"entity name","target":"反射符文"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"83a7223693d386ea39c9d8c7397b4625c76b5d5e020aaed271d4e0d1a7ee4b28","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75cd67f78d8a7db004a55e1997c92d8659247af2df68878a556b6663529c0acc","logical_entry_identity":"f73f45a1d397aed82255d129ba33aeb0679f1ef93e890ed7c703cb7320e10f4d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This fiery robe was worn by the mad pyromancer Halchot, who terrorised many towns in the late Age of Dusk, burning and looting villages as they tried to recover from the Spellblaze.  Eventually he was tracked down by the Ziguranth, who cut out his tongue, chopped off his head, and rent his body to shreds.  The head was encased in a block of ice and paraded through the streets of nearby towns amidst the cheers of the locals.  Only this robe remains of the flames of Halchot.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件炙热的长袍曾属于疯狂的烈焰术士哈克特。黄昏纪末期，他恐吓过许多城镇，在人们努力从魔法大爆炸中恢复之际烧杀抢掠村庄。最终他被伊格兰斯捕获了。伊格兰斯割下他的舌头，砍掉他的脑袋，并把他的身体撕成小块。他的脑袋被封在一个大冰块里，并且在附近城镇的居民欢庆中进行了游街。只有这件长袍从哈克特的烈焰中保留了下来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d26f16c80ef64df2ea7698e9c37edceed78fceb01c18557c2916ea75759d7992","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75ce1cb9740e6fe824e91df341772fd14232b5cdd2db957d4cd05e433c8a6375","logical_entry_identity":"448e488b80b638de1ca9108cd156b55956ebe93af9f69729ea4bc5dc33e9a451","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of pilfering","source_tag":"entity name","target":"偷窃之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"96fad4cb5589e435789a6548201d693a91fa8f11282001ae1b4f5882d30feae8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"75ce5232127e313d79ae8518919ac9