ed_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE#The air around %s grows cold and terrifying shapes begin to coalesce. A nightmare has begun.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#F53CBE#%s周围的空气开始变得冰冷并形成了一种令人恐怖的形状，噩梦开始了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e2e2e6e527176a09556896aaac0ca49382af3eebf21901b76ef5fc3e5517ba6b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7602a0bb0832f8b2155f23e41ad83d51fe7c44592dfa90bd06c2ffb99bdbd99b","logical_entry_identity":"f882602be8b143881343a9a27486d65a80d231be947a8e313fc2954ee9b53b67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"We preserve the past to protect the future. The hands of time are guarded by the arms of war.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们平衡过去，守护未来，我们用战斗来维持时间的秩序。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aaed6149136f0d21be504f63b47a9eb5296d1a8af089828e844ad1023c1715d4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7602f99bff2bcb058e15b6a7526a82fe41be7d57f19e7f83ac0ad94044e7dbe5","logical_entry_identity":"2715f80c1d47a0b41a25927b64200ecc26797b9e8fc17b91f2a5ac571f9868d5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORANGE#%s's dream shield has been strengthened by the attack!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#ORANGE#%s 的梦境屏障被攻击强化了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fcb10eb08a670d5245d2d4922e2c0b154b8b1dfbd6974eef8d6beec819a58bbd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76039955a0a78dc3fb8ff5c09ac001b793869691bddbc197c2205398db82b050","logical_entry_identity":"4d21fb5d0859e70f29e4cbd5a5a23f2baa17ae91365f828940ee115ce983d177","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"We both know the strength of the arcane; we both hunger for power. There is so much I have discovered, so much I could teach you.\nThis place is special. The veil of reality is thin here, forever shattered by the Spellblaze. We are taking advantage of this; we can draw on the power,\nleeching from this place, to better ourselves, to bring forth the dominion of magic!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们都深知奥术的力量，也都渴求力量。我探索出了许多奥秘，有太多的东西可以传授给你。\n这个地方非同寻常。这里的现实帷幕无比脆弱，已被魔法大爆炸永久撕碎。我们正善加利用这一点；我们可以汲取其中的力量，\n从此处不断榨取，以提升我们自身，迎来魔法的统治！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4caf0929c10eb5f69ae9035286a09c58acbed317206e8dc04a73fec81b7d9f94","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"760ab4ade06a4bf826cb6e65a38a6bce3afd591171bf2bb8283d396e612145f8","logical_entry_identity":"ec675002b70e2709e653914dbc2b5c19ca651cd1c0411481bfd732a1cd07ab02","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"library","source_tag":"entity name","target":"图书馆"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc209b29d7fff0d27badeb0ff1f094f32692accc390095fd8294ec5d04426120","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7618204109ddd50c786bfc8a7f79d27afb7bba960d7f292fe523fd66c6cdd48a","logical_entry_identity":"3cdacf39775984371ac82e71dfb91f2f2880d0adeca1223487c37d7d2d87154e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enter the arena (60 waves)","source_tag":"_t","target":"进入竞技场（60 波）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c4a52cb0504095085ab2236afeb4be737d31382b326219fd01bd7819912bb1ca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76190c61adf9e0f30cb833fb83e6500511dea57ceb08ee41cba4079a4abb074f","logical_entry_identity":"1884b4db8504025cac083175872e1a51b84fb1eafb5d0956f634ee52f5c0fe77","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"resist darkness","source_tag":"entity name","target":"提升暗影抗性"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7573623f03ee457ac4d22a701b3c8bfa58284081f6f88033ce246f3193c5f406","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"761cf2388aebfbe984d479a5c8e3a89ec96ee07d6e5fdcd6e107673c99275073","logical_entry_identity":"cbdb4d31b3f90820b412d243a4a2a6f097bd801d56bab739ece390b747b8d93f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your ammo is incompatible with your missile launcher.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的弹药类型与导弹发射器不匹配。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"85da5b42a94123c351050a41e47a8b9f2bf60fdb08670920aa6b8b9a86ce3fb6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76300515f072fd45d84e3bd85a753a37bb7bcd46b88688c3fea04fe2330aea95","logical_entry_identity":"16c38a623c7bdbbb2726c01